<title>INDIA: Miss World crown won by Greek model.</title>
<headline>Miss World crown won by Greek model.</headline>
<dateline>BANGALORE, India 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irene Skliva of Greece was crowned Miss World on Saturday at the end of a three-hour pageant overshadowed by protests and threats by militant women to commit suicide by immolation.</p>
<p>The 18-year-old professional model won the title after police had detained about 1,500 protesters in the southern Indian city of Bangalore.</p>
